{
  "id": "cowboys-and-vikings",
  "title": "Cowboys & Vikings",
  "description": "<p>The official game system for <strong>Cowboys &amp; Vikings</strong> — a weird-west frontier RPG where the Awakening of 1805 tore the Aether open over the American plains. Includes character, adversary, hazard and crew actors; the d20 + Advantage/Fortune dice engine; Parry/Dodge combat with Soak, Wounds and Strain; the Channeling magic system with Wild Surges; Bonds, Negotiations, Skill Challenges; and compendiums of talents, spells, gear, runes, concoctions, adversary maneuvers and roll tables.</p>",
  "version": "1.1.0",
